url: "https://github.com/mateuszjaskowski-lgtm/axspa-yolo-cls"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for nominal four-class morphology classification
  of prepared lateral spinal radiographs. Includes the completed cleaned-data
  experiment with 579 training, 95 validation and 150 external-test images,
  four model configurations and five seeds. The reference is YOLO11l-cls seed 0.
  The development split used manual, content-independent selection of numerical
  file ranges within classes before the first training. The author confirmed on
  2026-10-06 that the external cohort had not been used before final evaluation.
  The original plan was verbal; the locked computational protocol is archived
  separately. PNG images are available on reasonable request.
